<SiteLayout title="Cookie Policy | Roofriva Demo" description="Template cookie policy for the Roofriva demonstration roofing website."><section class="inner-hero"><div class="shell"><h1>Cookie Policy</h1></div></section><section class="prose"><div class="content-shell"><p><strong>Template notice:</strong> This cookie policy is demonstration content and must be reviewed against the real website's analytics, advertising, form and consent tools before production launch.</p><h2>Essential technology</h2><p>The website may rely on essential browser or hosting functionality needed to deliver pages securely and process requested features. Essential technology should not be used for unrelated advertising purposes.</p><h2>Analytics and preference cookies</h2><p>This demo does not assume that optional analytics or advertising tools are enabled. If a future client adds those services, their cookies, purposes, retention periods and consent requirements must be documented accurately.</p><h2>Managing cookies</h2><p>Visitors can use browser controls to remove or block cookies. Blocking essential storage can affect site functionality. A consent banner should only be enabled when the deployed integrations and applicable requirements make it necessary.</p></div></section></SiteLayout>